<div id="cook">
  <section class="intro">
    <%= image_tag "cooking-title.svg", alt: "Let's get cooking", class: "cooking-title" %>
  </section>
  <section class="story-section">
    <div class="row m-0 h-100">
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 p-0 min-height">
        <div class="pan position-relative h-100 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">
          <%= image_tag "pot.png", alt: "pot", class: "pot" %>
          <%= image_tag "blobs-cook.svg", alt: "blobs", class: "blobs-cook" %>
          <%= image_tag "blobs-cook-2.svg", alt: "blobs", class: "blobs-cook-2" %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 p-0 min-height">
        <div class="story h-100">
          <strong class="story-heading">So my story goes...</strong>
          <p class="paragraph">I've always found such joy in eating.. Choosing my breakfast, lunch or dinner has forever been an important part of my day. In fact, when I was younger, my father used to ask me every night what I wanted for breakfast the next day because he knew that this was the only way that would get me to go to sleep - I had something delicious to look forward to!</p>
          <p class="paragraph">So it was only natural that I took it upon myself to learn how to cook. It started when I moved to London at 18 years old. Living alone was the frst opportunity I got to care of myself, and I didn't want to live of of food deliveries. </p>
          <%= button_tag "Read more", class: "read-more-link", data: { bs_toggle: "modal", bs_target: "#readMoreModal" } %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="sunchef-cook-section d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">
    <div class="position-relative">
      <% @categories.each do |category| %>
        <% if category.to_sym == :lunch_dinner %>
          <%= link_to recipes_path(category: :lunch_dinner), class: "position-absolute category-link lunch" do %>
            <%= image_tag "lunch.svg", alt: category %>
          <% end %>
          <%= link_to recipes_path(category: :lunch_dinner), class: "position-absolute category-link dinner" do %>
            <%= image_tag "dinner.svg", alt: category %>
          <% end %>
        <% else %>
          <%= link_to recipes_path(category:), class: "position-absolute category-link #{category}" do %>
            <%= image_tag "#{category}.svg", alt: category %>
          <% end %>
        <% end %>
      <% end %>
      <%= link_to recipes_path do %>
        <%= image_tag "cook-sunchef.svg", alt: "Sunchef", class: "sunchef-cook-img" %>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="position-relative">
    <div class="shake-blend-section">
      <%= image_tag "casserol-and-blobs.svg", alt: "casserol and blobs", class: "casserol-and-blobs" %>
      <div class="row m-0">
        <div class="col-12 col-md-8 p-0 shake-bake-wrapper">
          <h2 class="shake-bake-title">shake, blend</h2>
          <h2 class="shake-bake-title">& bake your way</h2>
          <h2 class="shake-bake-title">to the top!</h2>

          <p class="shake-bake-paragraph">Cooking is an act of self care. Beyond providing nourishment, it can be a therapeutic and absolutely pleasurable activity. When you immerse yourself in the experience of preparing a dish - you take time for yourself and engage all fve of your senses. It can help you get out of your head and be present. Working with pure, healthy ingredients also makes cooking a time to regard and be grateful towards nature and our fabulous earth. </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tips-section d-flex flex-column justify-content-end">
      <div class="d-flex d-md-block justify-content-center mb-4 mb-md-0">
        <%= image_tag "bottle.svg", alt: "bottle", class: "bottle-img" %>
      </div>
      <div class="row m-0 h-100">
        <div class="col-12 col-md-7 offset-md-5 h-100 d-flex align-items-end justify-content-center tips-text-wrapper">
          <div class="tips-text">
            <p class="mb-0">Get comfortable! Create an ambience and play your favorite tunes. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">Get organised! Arrange your ingredients on the table for easy access. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">Get ahead! Read the recipe in advance for a smooth and stress free process. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">Get yourself some water!</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="remember-breath-section d-flex align-items-center justify-content-end">
      <div class="d-flex align-items-end justify-content-end">
        <%= image_tag "star.svg", alt: "star", class: "me-2" %>
        <p class="m-0">Oh, & remember to breathe.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
<div id="readMoreModal" class="modal fade" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="readMoreModal" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-dialog-scrollable">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-body p-4">
        <h4>So my story goes...</h4>
        <p>I've always found such joy in eating.. Choosing my breakfast, lunch or dinner has forever been an important part of my day. In fact, when I was younger, my father used to ask me every night what I wanted for breakfast the next day because he knew that this was the only way that would get me to go to sleep - I had something delicious to look forward to!</p>
        <p>So it was only natural that I took it upon myself to learn how to cook. It started when I moved to London at 18 years old. Living alone was the first opportunity I got to care for myself, and I didn't want to live off of food deliveries.</p>
        <p>I equipped my college dorm kitchenette with the basic necessary tools and stepped into a regular cooking routine. Not gonna lie, at the beginning, a lot of my meals were questionable in terms of healthy options.</p>
        <p>But in 2019, I was diagnosed with acute Candida - a yeast infection in the gut. The symptoms included feeling constantly bloated and tired. To battle the condition and reduce its effects, I decided to take on a 3-month intensive cleanse - this included cutting out Wheat, Yeast, Dairy, Corn and Sugar. The positive results were evident, and I managed to considerably decrease its levels.</p>
        <p>The cleanse also instantly made a difference in my mood, energy levels and the way I felt after meals. This newfound realization that I could take control of my health made me feel empowered and motivated. I did not want these efforts to go to waste once I reintegrated the foods I usually ate. I knew I had to listen more carefully to my body. This is when I understood the strong correlation between "good food, good mood".</p>
        <p>This is when I started to challenge my cooking and explore a variety of whole foods I had never given attention to before. This is also where I discovered the joys and benefits of plant-based meals, and began my exciting relationship with seeking health and happiness through balance!</p>
        <p>Eventually, I found cooking to be a therapeutic activity, a source of self care through which I can nourish my mind as much as my body. I encourage you to find your balance in cooking and I am here to inspire you to do so with easy, tasty and healthy recipes!</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
